        "created_at": "2015-03-12T15:53:18.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Based upon what I saw in the PAX East twitch feeds, it seams like some times, people have taken move actions more than once with the same bot, typically swift bot. &nbsp;Now I know that Go, Bots! is an unlimited action, but I assumed that the actions taken by the bots from it where still limited to once per turn as normal?</p>",
