        "created_at": "2015-03-12T15:55:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Move is a limited action, so i'm pretty sure Bots can only only use it once as well. With the case of Swift Bot, it has an action on its card that allows it to move up to 3 spaces and make an attack. Is this what they were doing at the tournament?</p><p>Edit: There is also the Sprint Action, which allows movement.</p>",
