      {
        "id": 137112,
        "name": "Donner",
        "username": "Donner",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/donner/{size}/1903_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-03-12T18:44:15.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>In PAX South they asked this question. &nbsp;Bots don't really get their own turns. &nbsp;They only get actions from Fo, bots! And it is unlimited. &nbsp;Christopher comments that the player should use this to attack (or move?) multiple times in one turn during the commentary of one of the games.</p>",
        "post_number": 7,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:13:25.106Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
