        "read": true,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>In PAX South they asked this question. &nbsp;Bots don&#39;t really get their own turns. &nbsp;They only get actions from Fo, bots! And it is unlimited. &nbsp;Christopher comments that the player should use this to attack (or move?) multiple times in one turn during the commentary of one of the games.</p>",
        "actions_summary": [],
        "moderator": false,
